<PlainPage title="Privacy Policy" description="How Belgium420 handles the information you send when you shop.">
  <h1>Privacy <span>Policy</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">This page covers the shop at belgium420.com. It is a plain summary of how orders are handled, not a lawyer-drafted policy.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you place an order we store the name, email, phone, shipping address, cart, and the reward or referral codes you choose to enter. The browser also keeps a cart, an age check, and a loyalty id on your device so checkout can remember you.</p>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>We use that information to confirm payment, ship the package, and apply referral credit or loyalty discounts. We do not sell customer lists.</p>
  <h2>Who can see an order</h2>
  <p>Order records are available to the shop operator through the admin desk. Payment details are confirmed by email. Do not send card numbers through the order form.</p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:mstwntdpacks@gmail.com">mstwntdpacks@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</PlainPage>
